<title>INDIA: CRICKET-INDIA BEAT SOUTH AFRICA IN OPENING TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA BEAT SOUTH AFRICA IN OPENING TEST.</headline>
<dateline>AHMEDABAD, India 1996-11-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>India beat South Africa by by 64 runs on the fourth day of the first test on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scores: India 223 and 190. South Africa 244 and 105 (H. Cronje 48 not out, J. Srinath 6-21).</p>
